{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50734","headline":"投韩员外六韵 · 张祜","name":"投韩员外六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"见说韩员外，声华溢九垓。\n大川舟欲济，荒草路初开。\n耸地千浔壁，（「千浔」，疑应作「千寻」。\n）森云百丈材。\n狂波心上涌，骤雨笔前来。\n後学无人誉，先贤亦自媒。\n还闻孔融表，曾荐祢衡才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50734.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50734","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}